{"ID":"20240118151121-maos0tb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151121-maos0tb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151121-maos0tb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151121-xxglqaz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132420-13o9c14\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132420-13o9c14\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:89,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:89\u0026#125;","title":"205桑根白皮（桑白皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240201134739"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151121-xxglqaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151121-xxglqaz","updated":"20240122132349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘，寒，无毒。治伤中，五劳，六极，羸瘦，崩中，脉绝，补虚益气。叶，主除寒热，出汗。桑耳，平。黑者。治女子漏下赤白汁，血病，症瘕积聚，阴痛，阴阳寒热，无子。（王不留行散）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132355-4hzumsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132355-4hzumsh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，其根皮入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132356-9n2r9x5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132356-9n2r9x5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘辛，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132358-i1lnnvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132358-i1lnnvm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】桑白皮为泻肺火行水道要药，主肺气喘满伤中，益气，开胃，消痰，解渴，治咳嗽吐血，去肺中水气，水肿腹满。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132400-bi1kx6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132400-bi1kx6q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】去肺中水气，唾血，热渴，水肿腹满胪胀，利水道，去寸白，可以缝金疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132402-bvxknvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132402-bvxknvw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治肺气喘满，虚劳客热，头痛，内补不足。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132404-vhv75mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132404-vhv75mb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】调中下气，消痰止渴，开胃下食，杀腹脏虫，止霍乱吐泻，研汁治小儿天吊惊痫客忤。及敷鹅口疮，大验。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132405-lu0hr6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132405-lu0hr6n"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132407-52aqryl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132407-52aqryl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】肺虚无火，因风寒而嗽者均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132349-tpeg57r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132349-tpeg57r"}},{"ID":"20240122132407-3mejkv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132407-3mejkv2"}},{"ID":"20240122132408-toel7zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132408-toel7zx","updated":"20240201134527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"205，桑根白皮，其实就是桑白皮。桑树的根，当然你写桑根白皮也可以啦，现在都写桑白皮，简写就好了。经方里面也使用桑白皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240122132412-kievfkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132412-kievfkg","updated":"20240201134626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个在本草经里面来说的话，它专门治虚痨的病，还有象治女子的漏下，赤白带呀，肚子里面长硬块呀，症瘕啊都是硬块。象经方里面会有“王不留行散”，里面就有桑根白皮，这个产地，到处都有，桑树的根嘛。味道是甘辛，甘味，甜味里面加点辣的味道，有一点辣的味道。这两个就是阳。如果你遇到，这味，老师，这个又酸嘛又苦。酸加苦，我们称为涌泻，酸苦涌泻为阴药，辛甘发散为阳。酸苦涌泻是阴药。这一个药本身，甘味兼辛味，都在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240122132419-uaizorr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132419-uaizorr","updated":"20240201134659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】呢，桑白皮为泻肺火，行水道。诸位想想看，任何色白的，一定入肺。那辛甘呢发散，能够散肺里面的积水。肺中喘满，去肺中的水汽，水肿，腹满，通通可以用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132420-13o9c14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132420-13o9c14","updated":"20240201134739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你看，【别录】也在说，肚子胀满，腹水，通通可以使用。那这个肺气胀满啊，这个跟前面相同了。它的根、皮入药。所以我们桑树的根直接拿来切，连皮跟根一齐切在里面啊，就是桑白皮。诸位看这就是桑白皮的样子，桑根白皮。平常处方的时候，当然2钱，3钱啦，都没有关系。"}]}]}